WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:09.710
Speaker 1: OK, for months now, the right has
been saying Joe Biden and Kamala Harris are

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:15.540
doing something really bad by not going to
the US Mexico border.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.980
They should go there.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:22.820
Now, there's a separate discussion to be had
about do you need to go to the border to properly

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:26.020
manage what's going on with undocumented immigration?

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:31.610
There is a separate discussion about how is
the Biden administration managing what's going

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.629
on with undocumented immigration?

00:00:33.629 --> 00:00:35.710
Is there or is there not a crisis at the border?

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.719
What has actually changed, if anything, since
Donald Trump left office just over five months

00:00:40.719 --> 00:00:41.890
ago?

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:49.230
But the point here is that Republicans have
been going crazy, saying, why won't Joe go?

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.589
Why won't Comilla go?

00:00:50.589 --> 00:00:55.239
Here is a Republican published compilation
of why won't they go to the border?

00:00:55.239 --> 00:00:56.359
Remember this stuff?

00:00:56.359 --> 00:01:00.050
Speaker 2: He plans to visit the border.

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:01.339
You haven't been to the border.

00:01:01.339 --> 00:01:06.150
Speaker 3: So how do you respond to that criticism
and when will that visit come?

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.570
Speaker 1: When are you going to the border?

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:11.510
Speaker 2: Vice president, administration
has asked.

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:13.330
I don't know.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:18.640
I don't understand the point that you're making.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:19.950
Listen.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:30.060
Speaker 1: Well, Kamala Harris is now going
to be going to the border and of course, now

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:34.340
Republicans are completely satisfied and they
believe that they are doing the right thing

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.120
in the Biden administration.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.120
Just kidding.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.120
Obviously, they don't.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:43.470
Now, they have shifted to why is Kamala Harris
going to the wrong part of the border?

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:48.930
I it I know it sounds completely ridiculous,
but this is what they've now shifted to.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.400
And also, why is she going all of a sudden?

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.660
Well, you've been demanding it for months,
right?

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:58.430
So here is Republican Texas Senator Ted Cruz,
also known to many as Cancun.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:03.950
Cruz saying Kamala Harris is going to the
wrong part of the border.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.770
She's not going to see the things that she
needs to see.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:07.880
Take a look at this, I think.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:11.750
Speaker 4: But I got to say, even this announcement,
so she announces that they're going to El

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:12.750
Paso.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.060
El Paso is a lovely city.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.970
It is a beautiful place in Texas.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:21.700
It is not also it also doesn't happen to be
the locus of the crisis.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:27.200
So if you look at where the the Rio Grande
Valley is and the and for folks who aren't

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.920
from Texas, let me give you a sense.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.730
So El Paso is on the western tip of Texas.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:36.010
The Rio Grande is Valley is almost on the
southern tip of Texas.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.920
It's 800 miles away.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:45.400
To give you a sense of just how far they are,
Chicago, Illinois, is closer to Washington,

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:49.180
D.C. than El Paso is to McAllen.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:52.099
And so she's going where where the height
of the problem is.

00:02:52.099 --> 00:02:54.310
And let me tell you what Comilla needs to
do.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:56.280
Comilla, you need to go to the Rio Grande
Valley.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.860
Comilla, you need to go to McAllen.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:03.799
Comilla, you need to go to the Donner tent
facility, which is the tent city your administration

00:03:03.799 --> 00:03:04.799
is built.

00:03:04.799 --> 00:03:06.829
Speaker 1: This is beyond parody.

00:03:06.829 --> 00:03:13.459
This is how it now she's doing the thing you've
been saying she should do, but now it's no

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.159
longer the right thing.

00:03:15.159 --> 00:03:20.459
These people cannot really be dealt with in
a serious way because of this.

00:03:20.459 --> 00:03:22.969
All along, they said the issue was she's not
going to the border.

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:23.969
Well, now she is.

00:03:23.969 --> 00:03:25.060
And it's the wrong part.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.519
Here is Fox News reporter Peter Doocy.

00:03:27.519 --> 00:03:28.519
Steve.

00:03:28.519 --> 00:03:29.519
No, Peter.

00:03:29.519 --> 00:03:31.579
Yes, Peter Doocy is the son.

00:03:31.579 --> 00:03:36.889
Peter Doocy asking White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki why, why?

00:03:36.889 --> 00:03:38.409
Why is this happening?

00:03:38.409 --> 00:03:39.409
Take a look at this.

00:03:39.409 --> 00:03:41.099
Speaker 4: So about today's announcement.

00:03:41.099 --> 00:03:46.139
Why is the vice president visiting the border
this week when earlier this month she dismissed

00:03:46.139 --> 00:03:48.700
a trip like that, saying it would be a grand
gesture?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:54.219
Speaker 5: She also said in an interview with
NBC that she would be open to going to the

00:03:54.219 --> 00:03:55.719
border if it was an appropriate time.

00:03:55.719 --> 00:03:57.080
She said that after she said that.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.829
So that's important context as well.

00:03:58.829 --> 00:04:04.019
Speaker 1: And this is just a reminder, OK,
this is just a reminder that we can't take

00:04:04.019 --> 00:04:08.269
them seriously because they don't deserve
to be taken seriously.

00:04:08.269 --> 00:04:13.019
As soon as you engage with them in what you
believe to be a serious matter and say, OK,

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:16.250
we're going to go to the border, let's figure
out what's going on there, this is what you

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.250
wanted.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.000
Now, all of a sudden, it's it's the wrong
place.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:24.760
And we now know this, that the other thing
this is why I say don't even engage.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:29.680
And when when we say, oh, well, why is Joe
Biden wasting time inviting Republicans to

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:32.639
the White House to talk about a bill he wants
to pass?

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:33.810
That makes sense to me.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:38.521
You're actually getting the people who if
they want to play a role in legislation, they

00:04:38.521 --> 00:04:41.419
can you bring them to the Oval Office.

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:44.060
Then they say we're not going to vote for
any of this stuff.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.030
And then you go forward and you do it on your
own.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.800
But you say, listen, I gave them a shot.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:51.560
That's one thing, because that's legislators
with this type of stuff.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.780
Go to the border, go, OK, we're going.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:54.000
Well, now it's the wrong place.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.250
And why now in the timing is suspect.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.349
I don't think it makes any sense to engage
with it whatsoever.

00:04:59.349 --> 00:05:01.669
If you think it does make sense, let me know.

00:05:01.669 --> 00:05:04.840
I see no upside whatsoever.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:05.919
These people are pathetic.

00:05:05.919 --> 00:05:07.210
They will never be satisfied.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.760
This is the game.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.949
It's grievance culture and outrage.

00:05:10.949 --> 00:05:17.740
The right has made it a regular talking point
to say that the left has become about grievances.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:51.060
I'm seeing that on the right, my friends,
and this is a perfect example 

00:05:51.060 --> 00:06:43.639
of it.

